00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:25.826 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit Barack Obama.

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:31.998 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "La frontière au sud est

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:33.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
grande ouverte, dit-il.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:34.434 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des millions d'illégaux

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:39.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
envahissent notre pays", dit

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:40.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donald Trump qui n'a toujours

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:42.242 size:53% position:73% line:53%
